--- Path reconciliation (no silent drift) ---
The generated prompt names the output `apps/windows/TeslaSync/Features/Battery/VampireDrainPage.xaml`
+ `VampireDrainPageViewModel.cs`. That project/folder does NOT exist in this repo. The real,
gate-passing W7 predecessors (page:battery/EnergyProducts, page:battery/BatteryCells,
page:driving/RegenEfficiency, …) live in project `TeslaSync.App` under `feature-views/<Page>/` as
code-only WinUI `UserControl`s (no XAML markup file) split into <Page>.cs (view) + .Model.cs +
.Source.cs + .ViewModel.cs, with the pure-C# model/source/viewmodel linked into TeslaSync.App.Tests
and the view registered in the NavigationView via ShellWindow.xaml.cs PageFactory.Register. Honesty
Covenant #7 (no predecessor bypass): this unit follows that identical, accepted structure rather than
the templated path.

